<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 50 mln stg late help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 50 mln stg late help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK money market with around 50 million stg of unspecified assistance through its late repo facility.</p>
<p>In total, the Bank provided the money market with 1.85 billion stg in liquidity, matching its final money market shortage forecast exactly.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
</text>
